 <h1 class="hero__title">Notice of Privacy Practices</h1>
 <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> September 1, 2026</p>
 <p class="hero__lead">This notice describes how medical information about you may be used and disclosed and how you can get access to this information. Please review it carefully.</p>
 <p class="form-phi-notice"><strong>This notice is current as of September 1, 2026 and is under legal review.</strong></p>
